      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "## Platform Observability Overview\nThis dashboard follows the current read-only platform boundary: Prometheus scrape health, backend API responsiveness, collector-backed snapshot signals, and persisted sync-history evidence derived from bounded inventory and topology sync runs.\n\nCurrent limits:\n- `app-api` and `gnmi-collector` expose meaningful metrics today.\n- Inventory and topology sync history now surfaces through persisted sync-run metrics.\n- Policy remains a live transient read-side slice, so policy history is intentionally not shown as persisted activity here.\n- ODL, Grafana, and Postgres exporter metrics remain future placeholders and are intentionally excluded from active panels.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "title": "Dashboard Scope",
      "type": "text"
    },
